1
00:00:00,236 --> 00:00:03,276
(Sheldon:)Albert Einstein
never had a driver's license.

2
00:00:03,907 --> 00:00:08,537
(Howard:)Yeah, but Albert Einstein didn't make me
wet myself at 40 miles an hour.

3
00:00:09,079 --> 00:00:11,999
(Penny:)Yeah, and I never wanted
to kick Albert Einstein in the nuts.

4
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:19,840
(Penny:)You know, I gotta ask, why didn't you just
get a license at 16 like everybody else?

5
00:00:20,006 --> 00:00:22,716
(Sheldon:)I was otherwise engaged.

6
00:00:23,426 --> 00:00:24,756
(Penny:)Doing what?

7
00:00:24,928 --> 00:00:28,268
(Sheldon:)Examining perturbative amplitudes
in N=4 supersymmetric theories...

8
00:00:28,431 --> 00:00:31,101
(Sheldon:)...leading to a re-examination
of the ultraviolet properties...

9
00:00:31,267 --> 00:00:35,647
(Sheldon:)...of multi-loop N=8 supergravity
using modern twistor theory.

10
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:41,610
Well, how about when you were 17?

11
00:00:42,612 --> 00:00:44,782
(DMV Lady(to the person ahead of Sheldon in the queue):)Take this to the testing area.
Name at the top.

12
00:00:44,948 --> 00:00:47,368
(DMV Lady(to the person ahead of Sheldon in the queue):)Sign the bottom, answer
the questions, bring it back. Next.

13
00:00:53,998 --> 00:00:55,038
(DMV Lady(to the person ahead of Sheldon in the queue):)Application?

14
00:00:56,126 --> 00:01:00,026
(Sheldon:)I'm actually more of a theorist.

